[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よし。\nこれで、目的の鉱石は採取できた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...There. That's all the minerals we came for."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レジナさん、協力してくれてありがとう。\n……姉さんも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for your help, Regina. ...And you too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レジナ、私からもありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, thank you, Regina. From me as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっはは、力になれたならよかったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, glad I could help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レジナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Regina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、これから二人はどうする予定？\n紀行文のための旅を続けるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, what are you two planning from here? Continuing your travels for the travelogue?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レジナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Regina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実は、このハイネ州が旅の最後の目的地だったの。\nこの後は王都州に戻る予定よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, Haine Province was our last stop. We'll be heading back to the royal capital after this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。気を付けて帰るんだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, well take care on the way back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レジナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Regina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レジナ、また会いましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Until next time, Regina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん。またね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah. See you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はこれから、これまでの旅の内容をまとめて\n本にする作業を進めるわ……ミルカはどうするの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll get started on putting together everything from our travels into the book... What about you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……採取したものを整理するわ。\n珍しいものも手に入ったから、色々と見てみる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm going to sort through what we collected. We picked up some rare things — I want to take a closer look."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう、分かった。\nアトリエに行くのよね。気を付けて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. You're heading to the atelier, then. Be careful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……またね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah. See you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よし、この鉱石があれば――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Alright. With these minerals, I should be able to—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お邪魔しまーす……って、あ！\u3000ミルカ！\n帰って来てたんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excuse me— oh! Miruca! You're back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカさん！\u3000お帰りなさい！\nユリエさんとの旅は、どうでしたか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca! Welcome home! How was the trip with Jurie?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……悪くなかった。\n色々と、いい素材も手に入ったし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Not bad at all. We managed to find some really good materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちは、水遊び楽しめた？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you two have fun in the water?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょー楽しかったよ！\n今度は絶対、ミルカも一緒に遊ぼうね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was so much fun! Next time you're definitely coming with us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ところでミルカさん。\nこんなにたくさんの素材、何に使うんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, Miruca — you have so many materials here. What are they all for?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見たところ、何か調合の準備中かなって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It looks like you're getting ready for some kind of synthesis..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……それなんだけど――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That's actually what I wanted to talk about—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、調合したいものがあるの。\nシャル、シャリー……手伝ってくれないかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's something I want to make. Lotte, Stera... would you help me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]